<% if @problems.empty? -%>
Nothing needs attention this week.
<% else -%>
<%= @problems.size %> of <%= @findings.size %> checks need attention.
<% end -%>

<% @findings.each do |f| -%>
<%= f.ok ? "OK" : "!!" %>  <%= f.area %>
    <%= f.detail %>
<% end -%>

--
This report is sent every Monday whether or not anything is wrong. That is
deliberate: if it stops arriving, something has gone wrong with the scheduler
itself, and no alert would have been sent either.
